{
  "journey": "Proposed - CHED-D - Food and Feed of Non-Animal Origin",
  "version": "2.0",
  "description": "Presentation layer only. Defines screens, fields, field types, labels, and visibility. Schema paths and commodity conditions live on obligations. Screen visibility is emergent: if all of a screen's fields' obligations are inactive, the runtime skips the screen.",
